mindmap
  root((Nooreign))
    Atlas
      Kingdoms
        12 realms with terrain, crest and capital
        creed, motto, questions
        aiStance headline + verdict
        relations: alliance / rivalry / vassal / debate / succession
      Cartography
        relationGraph + centrality
        territoryBounds (nearest-capital partition)
        distantPairs (the estranged pair)
    Court
      Advisors
        28 on 12 benches
        six-axis axiom vector each
        temperament: caution ambition solidarity formality
        voice: register, cadence, tells
      Argument moves
        premise / objection / synthesis / appeal
        weight in [0,1]
        leansOn: AxiomKey[]
        appliesTo: dilemma tags or option ids
      Voices
        deterministic speech from stored text
        no model call, no invented attribution
    Deliberation
      Axiom calculus
        scoreOptionWith = dot product / weightSum
        weighAdvisor = 0.7 self + 0.3 kingdom
        decidingAxis
        distance, balance, describeProfile
      Utilons
        stakeholder-weighted total
        fairnessIndex (normalised Gini)
        utilonScale bands
        moralStatusRisk amplifier
      Council
        runCouncil rounds 1-3
        decision + tie-break policy
        superMajority + minorityReport
        synthesis from the minority when close
        seeded jitter, cap 0.05
      Argument graph
        buildGraph + target resolution
        topologicalOrder + cycle detection
        inheritedWeight (INHERITANCE 0.4)
        toMermaid
    Chronicle
      32 eras, -470 to 2026
      eraIndex contiguous windows
      buildRail + year/position invertibility
      progressOf - the stack rebuilds
      diffEras, milestonesFor, highlightEras
    Observatory
      20 techniques in 6 towers
      coverageMatrix over the six axes
      gapAnalysis severity blend
      readinessScore with breadth bonus
      dependencyHealth: dangling + cycles
      costBenefit maturity per cost
    Dilemmas
      20 cases, 2-5 options each
      analyseDilemma - pivot and settled axes
      courtReading - preview without a council
      cautiousValue - currency discounted for risk
    Experiments
      8 scorers, one per model
      additive not multiplicative terms
      JITTER_BOUND 0.03 keyed on value
      sweep and sweepGrid
      phaseOf from the worst metric
    Codex
      120 glossary terms
      28 canon texts
      BM25-style search index
      reflective prompts
    Platform
      Turborepo, raw TS packages
      Next.js 15 App Router, RSC
      Tailwind v4 theme tokens
      packages/ui design system
      optional FastAPI service
      Rust parity crate
